# Python Project

A minimal Python project scaffold with sample code and tests.

## Setup

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -U pip
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Run sample code

```bash
python -m python_project
```

## Run tests

```bash
pytest
```
